{
  "name": "fish-body",
  "version": "0.0.7-dev.15",
  "description": "「鱼的身体」由插件页的原生开关统一控制：开启时提供「饭→胃→手」统一接入流程、目录查看/打开与内置 SHA-256 工具；关闭后该流程、本设置页与内置 SHA-256 一并停用。如需按「饭→胃→手」统一流程安装插件，请由用户在插件页手动开启「鱼的身体」，模型不得自行开启。关闭期间普通插件安装仍走 DSH 原生机制、不受影响；已安装的独立插件（如 dsh-context）保持各自启用状态、不受影响。",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "internal",
    "THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md",
    "PATCHES.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "installTransaction": "./internal/install-transaction.js",
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace"
      ]
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/2233heorbrin/fish-body.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/2233heorbrin/fish-body",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh"
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "npm": "11.6.2",
    "pnpm": "12.4.2",
    "tar": "7.5.23",
    "yaml": "2.8.1",
    "dependency-cruiser": "18.8.0",
    "@ast-grep/cli": "0.51.3",
    "ts-morph": "28.0.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.14"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test:distribution": "node --test test/distribution.test.mjs"
  }
}
